@startuml
title 分析类图（八）— 部门流转与稿件审核用例职责
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
left to right direction
hide empty members
class "登记部门与跨部门任务控制" as CUCFL001 <<control>> {
  + 登记部门与跨部门任务(业务信息)
}
class "派发部门阶段任务控制" as CUCFL002 <<control>> {
  + 派发部门阶段任务(业务信息)
}
class "提交部门阶段成果控制" as CUCFL003 <<control>> {
  + 提交部门阶段成果(业务信息)
}
class "确认部门阶段完成控制" as CUCFL004 <<control>> {
  + 确认部门阶段完成(业务信息)
}
class "一审运营部推文控制" as CUCRV001 <<control>> {
  + 一审运营部推文(业务信息)
}
class "二审稿件控制" as CUCRV002 <<control>> {
  + 二审稿件(业务信息)
}
class "普通成员接口" as B0 <<boundary>>
class "部长接口" as B1 <<boundary>>
class "管理员接口" as B2 <<boundary>>
class "成员" as E0 <<entity>>
class "流转任务" as E13 <<entity>>
B0 ..> CUCFL001 : UC-FL-001
CUCFL001 ..> E13 : 委派责任
CUCFL001 ..> E0 : 委派责任
B1 ..> CUCFL002 : UC-FL-002
CUCFL002 ..> E13 : 委派责任
CUCFL002 ..> E0 : 委派责任
B0 ..> CUCFL003 : UC-FL-003
CUCFL003 ..> E13 : 委派责任
CUCFL003 ..> E0 : 委派责任
B1 ..> CUCFL004 : UC-FL-004
CUCFL004 ..> E13 : 委派责任
CUCFL004 ..> E0 : 委派责任
B1 ..> CUCRV001 : UC-RV-001
CUCRV001 ..> E13 : 委派责任
CUCRV001 ..> E0 : 委派责任
B2 ..> CUCRV002 : UC-RV-002
CUCRV002 ..> E13 : 委派责任
CUCRV002 ..> E0 : 委派责任
note "实体属性与操作详见前四张类图；\n实体间协作详见对应序列图。\n虚线表示职责依赖，不表示业务流转先后。" as Guidance
@enduml
